Template for the SPOON-1 home pool — ckpool in solo mode (-B flag).
_muse — 2026-11-20. Notes:
- ckpool's mindiff/startdiff are integers in this build, so the home
  pool's difficulty floor is 1 (expected ~48 h per share for the
  Verilator bridge at ~24.5 kH/s; trivial for FPGA hardware later).
- Stratum binds to localhost only. The bridge runs on the same host.
- ckpool talks to the local Bitcoin Core 32.1 over JSON-RPC (the
  multiprocess IPC interface needs the bitcoin-node build; RPC is the
  documented fallback and is what we have).
- ckpool cannot serve work until the node finishes initial sync; until
  then it sits in its retry loop, which is the correct behaviour.
Comments from here on are ignored.
